{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-17", "prepared_on": "2026-08-17", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-17</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Stripe Reportedly in Talks to Acquire PayPal for $53 Billion<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Stripe傳以530億美元洽談收購PayPal</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The Wall Street Journal reports Stripe and Advent International are in deeper talks to acquire PayPal, after PayPal's board rejected an earlier $60.50-per-share offer as too low.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">華爾街日報報導，Stripe與私募股權基金Advent International已與PayPal就530億美元收購案進入更深入洽談，先前PayPal董事會曾以出價過低拒絕該提案。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178162\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Stripe Will Reportedly Acquire AI Gateway Startup OpenRouter for $7B+<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Stripe傳將以逾70億美元收購AI閘道新創OpenRouter</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenRouter's CEO has described the startup as \"Stripe for AI,\" and now Stripe itself is reportedly moving to acquire it for more than $7 billion.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenRouter執行長曾形容自家新創是「AI版的Stripe」，如今傳出Stripe本身將以超過70億美元收購該公司。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/16/stripe-will-reportedly-acquire-ai-gateway-startup-openrouter-for-7b/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> OpenAI Reportedly Disbanded Its Preparedness Team<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI傳解散前瞻風險評估小組</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">According to the Financial Times, OpenAI disbanded the team responsible for assessing whether its models pose serious risks and developing mitigations, at the end of last month.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">英國金融時報報導，OpenAI已於上月底解散負責評估模型是否具重大風險並研擬因應對策的「Preparedness」團隊。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/980817/openai-disbands-preparedness-team\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Anthropic CEO Says AI Backlash Is \"Fundamentally a Crisis of Trust\"<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic執行長：AI反彈聲浪「本質上是信任危機」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Dario Amodei is pushing back against claims he has painted an overly pessimistic picture of AI, framing public backlash instead as a trust problem.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Dario Amodei反駁外界認為他過度渲染AI悲觀前景的說法，並將大眾對AI的反彈聲浪定調為信任危機。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/16/anthropic-ceo-says-ai-backlash-is-fundamentally-a-crisis-of-trust/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> GeoServer Zero-Day Traced to GeoTools Component, OSGeo Confirms<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">GeoServer零時差漏洞根源確認為GeoTools元件，OSGeo回應</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">After a researcher publicly disclosed a GeoServer zero-day last week, exploitation attempts surfaced within hours; OSGeo says the flaw actually lies in the underlying GeoTools library.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">上週有研究人員公開GeoServer零時差漏洞後數小時即出現攻擊者嘗試利用的跡象，OSGeo指出問題實際上出在底層的GeoTools元件。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178169\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Just-Patched SAP Commerce Cloud Flaw with Perfect CVSS Score Already Under Attack<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">甫修補的SAP Commerce Cloud滿分漏洞傳出遭利用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Days after SAP patched Commerce Cloud vulnerability CVE-2026-58231, which scored a perfect 10.0 on CVSS, reports emerged of attackers attempting to exploit it.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">SAP在例行更新中修補CVSS滿分10分的Commerce Cloud重大漏洞CVE-2026-58231，事隔數日即傳出遭到嘗試利用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178160\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Google Lets Users Strip Watermarks from AI-Generated Media, Open-Sources Credentio<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google允許用戶移除AI生成影音浮水印，並開源Credentio函式庫</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google will let users disable the visible watermark on images, video, and music generated by Gemini models, while invisible SynthID and C2PA metadata remain embedded; it also open-sourced the C++ content-verification library Credentio.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google將讓用戶自行關閉Gemini生成圖片、影片與音樂的可見浮水印，但人眼不可見的SynthID與C2PA metadata仍會保留，同時開源用於內容驗證的C++函式庫Credentio。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178165\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Qwen's Open-Model Derivatives Surpass 150,000, 2.6x Meta's Count<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Qwen開放模型衍生版增至15萬個，為Meta的2.6倍</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Hugging Face's summer open-model ecosystem report shows Alibaba's Qwen now has 151,448 derivative models, far ahead of Google's 82,506 and 2.6 times Meta's total.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Hugging Face發布夏季開放模型生態報告，指出阿里巴巴Qwen衍生模型已達151,448個，遠高於Google的82,506個，也是Meta的2.6倍。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178170\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Cursor's Cloud Agents Pre-Build Dev Environments, Cutting First-Response Time by 3x<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Cursor Cloud Agents預先備妥開發環境，首次回應最高快3倍</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Cursor added a Builds mechanism that pre-clones repositories and installs dependencies in the background, speeding up environment startup 10x and cutting an agent's first response time by up to 3x; it becomes default from August 17.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Cursor替Cloud Agents加入預建環境機制Builds，提前完成複製儲存庫與安裝套件等工作，環境啟動速度提升10倍，代理首次回應最高加快3倍，8月17日起預設啟用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178148\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> ChatGPT's Computer History Tracks Your Clicks and Keystrokes<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">ChatGPT的Computer History功能會追蹤你的點擊與按鍵</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A new macOS desktop feature turns user actions into training data, learning work habits, suggesting automations, and building a timeline that ChatGPT and Codex can reference later.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">ChatGPT桌面版新功能Computer History會將用戶操作轉為訓練資料，學習工作習慣、建議自動化流程，並建立時間軸供ChatGPT與Codex日後參考。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/980742/chatgpts-computer-history-tracks-your-clicks-and-keystrokes\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}